# Homeware Store — CLAUDE.md

## Project Overview
Building a Next.js homeware e-commerce store from scratch. Single product to start
(sunset/galaxy projection lamp). Zero hosting cost (Vercel free tier). PayFast payment
gateway. SEO-optimised from day one. Domain already owned.

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Hosting: Vercel (free tier)
- Payment: PayFast (SA-native, ITN callback)
- Database: None for V1 — product data is static JSON

