## PayFast Integration

### .env.local (never commit)
PAYFAST_MERCHANT_ID=your_merchant_id
PAYFAST_MERCHANT_KEY=your_merchant_key
PAYFAST_PASSPHRASE=your_passphrase
PAYFAST_SANDBOX=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_STORE_URL=https://yourdomain.com

### Payment Flow
1. Customer fills details on /checkout
2. App builds signed PayFast form
3. Form POSTs to https://www.payfast.co.za/eng/process
4. PayFast processes payment
5. ITN hits /api/payfast/notify
6. Customer lands on /order-success or /order-cancelled

### Signature Generation
MD5 hash of all parameters sorted alphabetically, URL-encoded,
joined as query string. If passphrase set, append before hashing.

```js
import crypto from 'crypto'
export function generateSignature(data, passphrase = '') {
  const params = { ...data }
  if (passphrase) params.passphrase = passphrase
  const sorted = Object.keys(params)
    .sort()
    .map(k => `${k}=${encodeURIComponent(params[k]).replace(/%20/g, '+')}`)
    .join('&')
  return crypto.createHash('md5').update(sorted).digest('hex')
}
```

